# x509map VOMS FQAN map (libXrdSecEntityX509Map / libXrdAccX509Map "vomsmap=")
#
# Same syntax as the XRootD voms-mapfile: "<FQAN pattern>" <account>.
# The client's FQANs are tried in VOMS order (primary first); for each FQAN
# the rules are scanned top to bottom and the first match wins, so list
# specific roles before wildcards. '*' inside an element is a wildcard and
# a trailing "/*" matches any deeper group, role and capability.
# A more specific rule never matches a more generic FQAN.
"/cms/Role=production/Capability=NULL"  cmsprod
"/cms/Role=lcgadmin/Capability=NULL"    cmsprod
"/cms/Role=pilot/Capability=NULL"       cmspilot
"/cms/*"                                cms
#"/alice/*"                             alice
#"/belle/*"                             belle
